MODIFICATIONS MADE TO THE ORIGINAL WORK

The following files and areas have been modified from the original Squoosh
source code to create ShrinkImg:

  src/shared/prerendered-app/Intro/
    - Rewritten intro page: new branding, layout, copy, FAQ section,
      ad slots, footer, and demo section.

  src/shared/prerendered-app/colors.css
    - Complete rewrite: replaced Squoosh pink/blue palette with a new
      teal/coral palette; added dark mode variables.

  src/static-build/pages/index/base.css
    - Updated font stack (Inter), background pattern, cookie consent styles.

  src/static-build/pages/index/index.tsx
    - Updated metadata: title, description, theme-color, OG tags, manifest,
      structured data (FAQ), Google Fonts link, cookie consent banner.

  src/static-build/index.tsx
    - Updated PWA manifest: name, theme_color, background_color,
      description, screenshots, categories.

  src/client/lazy-app/Compress/style.css
    - Updated theme colors for both option panels (teal/coral).

  src/client/lazy-app/Compress/Output/custom-els/TwoUp/styles.css
    - Updated arrow colors to match new palette.

  src/shared/custom-els/loading-spinner/styles.css
    - Updated default spinner color to use new primary color variable.

  src/shared/custom-els/snack-bar/styles.css
    - Updated action button color to use success color variable.

  src/shared/prerendered-app/Intro/imgs/
    - All logo/brand assets replaced with new ShrinkImg origami-bird logo.

  src/static-build/assets/
    - All icons, favicon, and PWA assets replaced with new ShrinkImg branding.

  Removed features:
    - PWA install prompt button and associated logic.

